(This violates confidentiality and integrity requirements for healthcare data.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Recommended fix: Centralize authorization checks. Confirm that the patient exists and that the) Tj T*
(doctor has a valid appointment or approved clinical relationship. Apply the same checks to read,) Tj T*
(create, update, and delete operations.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Verification evidence: Authenticate as Doctor A and submit a record for Patient B without a) Tj T*
(relationship. The secure version should return 403 Forbidden.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(VULN-06: Excessive Medical-Data Exposure) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Severity: High) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Description: Health-card scanning returns a broad collection of patient information, including) Tj T*
(demographics, allergies, records, prescriptions, and appointments.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Evidence: app/api/health-card/scan/route.ts returns multiple sensitive healthcare datasets after) Tj T*
(a card lookup.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Impact: A compromised or misused doctor account can access more personal health information than) Tj T*
(necessary for a specific clinical task.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Recommended fix: Apply data minimization. Return only the fields required for the current) Tj T*
(workflow, require an authorized relationship or appointment, add consent and audit logging, and) Tj T*
(separate emergency access from ordinary access.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Verification evidence: Scan a card as an unrelated doctor. The secure version should deny access) Tj T*
(or return only the minimum permitted fields.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(VULN-07: Password-Hash Disclosure) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Severity: High) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Description: The admin staff endpoint returns staff documents without explicitly excluding the) Tj T*
(password field. Even a password hash must not be exposed through an API response.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Evidence: app/api/admin/staff/route.ts returns staff documents without a password projection.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Impact: A compromised administrator session, frontend bug, logging system, or browser extension) Tj T*
(could obtain password hashes and enable offline cracking.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Recommended fix: Use explicit response projections or DTOs that allow only safe fields. Never) Tj T*
(return the password field from any endpoint. Add automated tests that recursively check) Tj T*
(sensitive fields are absent from API responses.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Verification evidence: Call the staff endpoint as an administrator and confirm that no password) Tj T*
(property is returned.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(VULN-08: Security Misconfiguration) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET

endstream
